@host = http://localhost:5283
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@foodId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@mealId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@pageNumber = 1
@pageSize = 10

### Food - Get by Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Food/{{foodId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Food - Get Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Food/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Food - Create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Food
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### Food - Update
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Food
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{foodId}}"
}

###

### Food - Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/Food/{{foodId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Food View - Get by MealId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Food/View/Meal/{{mealId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Food View - Get by MealId Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Food/View/Meal/{{mealId}}/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


